                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fear of things located to one's right."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad6e4936-d2da-447b-ac4c-2733e9cad7cd",
                                                "sense_id": "a269b576-8f29-30dd-8dc1-875d9f8600f3",
                                                "text": "It also mentions coulrophobia (fear of clowns), dextrophobia (fear of objects at the right side of the body), and, one which parents are particularly prone to, ephebiphobia, or fear of teenagers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa4d60c7-f1f3-47ec-ad9f-3d54c894a13e",
                                                "sense_id": "a269b576-8f29-30dd-8dc1-875d9f8600f3",
                                                "text": "Unfortunately, there is no method of treatment, known to let people get rid of this problem of dextrophobia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
